At a glance the batch looks finished.

5
00:00:14,502 --> 00:00:15,441
It isn't quite.

6
00:00:15,441 --> 00:00:20,388
I'm not going to pretend the first batch comes out clean, because Sam's didn't.

7
00:00:20,388 --> 00:00:25,523
This section spends as much time on what goes wrong, colour drift, mangled text, a

8
00:00:25,523 --> 00:00:30,407
product that doesn't quite look like the product, as it does on the generation

9
00:00:30,407 --> 00:00:30,845
