17
00:00:50,836 --> 00:00:55,589
This one shows you Harlan's first batch failing in two specific, ordinary ways,

18
00:00:55,589 --> 00:01:00,583
because that's what actually happens, and knowing the failure in advance is most of

19
00:01:00,583 --> 00:01:01,967
